### Use VS-Code with extension "Rest Client from Huachao Mao" to 
### send these requests straight from VS code.
### Make sure to replace KEY with the corresponding api key

### [UAT] Outlets for employee
GET https://5fb3l518cc.execute-api.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uat/tradingOutlet/11513191 HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: KEY
content-type: 'application/json'

### [UAT] Menuplans for a specific outlet
GET https://5fb3l518cc.execute-api.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uat/menuplanlist/%outletId HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: KEY
content-type: 'application/json'

### [UAT] OutletMenuPlans -> returns recipes, menu plans etc. 
POST https://5fb3l518cc.execute-api.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uat/getoutletmenuplans HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
x-api-key: KEY

{
    "outlets": [
            {
                "id": "G20202",
                "menu_plans":[
                    "1"
                ]
            },
            {
                "id": "G20203",
                "menu_plans":[
                    "1"
                ]
            }
    ]
}
